<title>USA: Rite Aid Jan same-store sales rise 13.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Rite Aid Jan same-store sales rise 13.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CAMP HILL, Pa. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $800.1     $395.7     102.2	 13.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is	4 weeks ended	  Jan 25.</p>
<p>    Full company name is			    Rite Aid Corp</p>
<p>NOTES: Increased sales reflect comparison with weak, weather-hampered sales for same period a year ago.</p>
<p>Same-store sales for Thrifty PayLess stores were up 6.5 percent from the prior-year period.</p>
</text>
